msgctxt "124"
msgid "Guh... I'll get you for this, just you wait!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "We're never coming back here again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "You shouldn't use violence to solve your problems!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"I mean, it's our fault for having that conversation at\r\n"
"the register..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"We made everyone wait for us to finish talking. No wonder\r\n"
"they were mad at us..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Yeah, you've got a point there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"What do you think? Was his way the right way to handle\r\n"
"that situation?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Um..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"(Looks like he's having trouble finding the right answer.\r\n"
"All right, then...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "No, you're right. It wasn't the best way to handle that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I don't like it when people try to solve all their\r\n"
"problems with violence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"But his methods were different. He stood between you and\r\n"
"those punks to keep you from getting hurt. That's not the\r\n"
"same as violence, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Sensei..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"After all that, you've gotta see just how much he cares\r\n"
"about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"But... I don't want him to do stuff like that... All it does\r\n"
"is cause trouble for me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't want to cause more trouble by you asking me out\r\n"
"like that again... So if we could start off as friends, I'd\r\n"
"think about going on a date with you sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Huh? You mean..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"I mean, it took me off guard, but... I'm sure it took a lot\r\n"
"of courage to ask me out in front of all those people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Then you'll..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Just as friends, okay? It's up to you to convince me to\r\n"
"be anything more than that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Do you think he handled that the right way?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "I... I... I don't think he handled it the wrong way at all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"I'm not strong, like sensei here, but I know that sometimes,\r\n"
"you have to use violence to solve problems... You have to do\r\n"
"just what he did here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "But it's not right! Violence isn't the answer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"What is \"right\" to you? If the person I loved was in danger,\r\n"
"I'd do anything to protect them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"I don't think it's right to use violence to hurt someone...\r\n"
"But I'd do it to protect the person I love!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"I know it's hard to believe, since we've only just met,\r\n"
"but... I really do like you a lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"That's why I was willing to do anything I could to protect\r\n"
"you from those punks..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"I know... But it caused so much trouble for the shop,\r\n"
"and for me... I'd rather you not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Right... I get it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't want to cause more trouble by you asking me out\r\n"
"like that again... So if we could start off as friends, I'd\r\n"
"think about going on a date with you sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Huh? You mean..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"I mean, it took me off guard, but... I'm sure it took a lot\r\n"
"of courage to ask me out in front of all those people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "Then you'll..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"Just as friends, okay? It's up to you to convince me to\r\n"
"be anything more than that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "A... All right! I did it, sensei!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Good job, kid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"Okay, then... After your shift is over, let's go to the\r\n"
"Blue Seal Parlor, then to Sam's Maui, then after that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Those are all places to eat... Why don't I bring us some\r\n"
"burgers, and we can go see a movie?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "Okay! I'll wait for you outside the shop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"Thanks for everything, sensei. If you hadn't helped me, I\r\n"
"wouldn't have gotten anywhere with anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"Looks like getting turned down all those times helped me\r\n"
"grow a bit of backbone... hehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "Glad to hear it. Keep it up, kid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"Before you go, take this. I bought it with the hopes that\r\n"
"it'd make me more popular, but I don't need it now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "All right, I'll take it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "You got a slightly battered <Color:8>Italian Shoulder Bag<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"Thanks again! I've gotta go think about what we're gonna\r\n"
"do on our date..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "I'll lend him a hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "I'll watch and let him handle this."
msgstr ""

